 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Potion-danomi de Ikinobimasu! - Hanano to Rotte no Futari Tabi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ポーション頼みで生き延びます！ ハナノとロッテのふたり旅"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Will Survive Using Potions! - Hanano and Lotte's Journey"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hana, a junior at Kaoru's university, learns of the sudden death of Kaoru, whom she admired, and attends the funeral. On the way home, she gets into an accident and is reincarnated in another world. Hana is reincarnated in the same world as Kaoru, and is given a \"trivial\" ability, but the useless Hana collapses immediately. By chance, she is saved by Lotte, a girl who is an apprentice knight, and the mismatched duo begins their journey in another world.",
   "ja": "カオルの大学の後輩・芳乃（はなの）は、憧れていたカオルの突然の訃報を知り葬儀に参列する。その帰り道、不慮の事故に遭ってしまい、異世界転生を果たした。カオルを追いかけるように同じ世界に転生し、ハナノはある”些細な”能力を与えらるが、ポンコツなハナノは速攻で行き倒れてしまう。偶然、騎士見習いの少女・ロッテに救われ、でこぼこコンビで異世界ふたり旅が始まる。"
  },
